/ActualText (The Workshop on Applied Information Technologies and Artificial Intelligence Systems provides a unique platform for research and practical application of advanced achievements in the field of computational intelligence, machine learning, and big data processing. The event focuses on the development of intelligent systems and their integration into key areas of modernity \023 cybersecurity, Internet of Things \(IoT\) and ethical aspects of artificial intelligence. The workshop creates a space for fruitful cooperation between leading scientists, experienced developers, and industry practitioners, facilitating the exchange of expertise, development of innovative solutions, and establishment of long-term professional relationships, which ultimately accelerates the implementation of advanced technologies in real business processes and social needs.)
/K [9]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 1694 0 R
/Pg 820 0 R
>>
endobj
