/ActualText (The workshop will cover, but is not limited to, the following topics:\n\nComputational Intelligence and Machine Learning Methods\r\nDeep Learning Architectures and Neural Network Models\r\nMultimodal Artificial Intelligence and Video-Centric Large Language Models\r\nComputer Vision and Image-Based Intelligent Systems\r\nBiomedical Data Analytics and Artificial Intelligence in Healthcare\r\nBiosignal Processing and Neuroinformatics\r\nArtificial Intelligence for Industrial Monitoring and Predictive Maintenance\r\nCyber-Physical Systems and Intelligent Sensor-Based Environments\r\nInternet of Things, Edge AI, and Digital Twins\r\nBig Data Processing, Data Engineering, and Analytics for AI Systems\r\nInformation Systems, Computer Networks, and Applied AI Platforms\r\nCybersecurity and Trustworthy Artificial Intelligence Systems\r\nAI for Information Security, OSINT, and Social Media Intelligence\r\nNatural Language Processing and Multilingual Language Technologies\r\nMathematical Modeling, Optimization, and Decision-Support Systems\r\nSmart Systems for Enterprises, Cities, and Intelligent Environments\r\nEthical, Legal, and Regulatory Aspects of Artificial Intelligence\r\nEmerging Applications and Future Trends in Applied Artificial Intelligence\r\n)
